		{"id":"97f33940a4029b6f","type":"text","text":"Interactive or Assisted Installer ","x":1000,"y":-1716,"width":265,"height":50},
		{"id":"6ccfe4266edd2479","x":1330,"y":-1721,"width":548,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"- the easiest way to install OpenShift Container Platform\n- ideal approach for clusters with networks connected to the internet"},
		{"id":"925d5b536d7edd2d","type":"text","text":"Local Agent-based","x":1000,"y":-1609,"width":182,"height":50},
		{"id":"24441c492f818c03","x":1242,"y":-1639,"width":542,"height":110,"type":"text","text":"- ideal for disconnected environments.\n- you must download and configure the Agent-based Installer first. \n- Configuration is done with a command-line interface."},
		{"id":"d59400e94a8f770d","x":1485,"y":-1508,"width":835,"height":74,"type":"text","text":"- The installation program uses each cluster host’s baseboard management controller (BMC) for provisioning. \n- You can deploy clusters in connected or disconnected environments."},
		{"id":"56148b755c3ed3a0","type":"text","text":"Automated or Installer-Provisioned Infrastructure (IPI)","x":1000,"y":-1496,"width":432,"height":50},
		{"id":"81c14a89c6a8951d","type":"text","text":"Full control or User-Provisioned Infrastructure (UPI)","x":1000,"y":-1390,"width":407,"height":50},
		{"id":"9dc987b2fd5b5a26","x":1474,"y":-1403,"width":556,"height":77,"type":"text","text":"- provides maximum customizability. \n- You can deploy clusters in connected or disconnected environments."},
